3. Finding Email Addresses from a Domain

​a) Open Maltego and click New Graph to create a blank workspace.
​b) Drag the Domain entity from the Entity Palette onto the graph canvas.
​c) Update the domain node's value to your target domain (e.g networkwalks.com).
​d) Right-click the domain entity, select Run Transforms, and choose the relevant machine or transform (such as Email Address Footprint).
​e) Review and filter the resulting graph nodes to extract and document the email addresses linked to the target domain.